  "translation": "Wasuka umntu ukuba aye, yena nesisigqiza sakhe nesicaka sakhe; wathi kuye umkhweyo wakhe, uyise wentombazana: “Yakho nanga, uciphile umhla kude kungokuhlwa — helela ⟨ubusuku⟩ nceda; yakho, liyeza ukuphela umhla — lala apha, uze kulunge intliziyo yakho, nize nivuke kusasa nibe phambili ngendlela yenu, uze uye kwihema yakho.”",
